u003ci data-lucide\u003d\"mail-open\" class\u003d\"w-10 h-10\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv\u003e\n                        \u003ch3 class\u003d\"font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-rose-900 dark:text-rose-100\"\u003eKaty\u0027s eyes only\u003c/h3\u003e\n                        \u003cp class\u003d\"text-sm text-rose-700/70 dark:text-rose-300/70 mt-1 italic\"\u003eFrom your secret admirer\u003c/p\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class\u003d\"inline-block px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-200/60 dark:bg-rose-900/60 text-rose-800 dark:text-rose-200 text-xs font-semibold\"\u003e\n                        Click to Open Letter\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n\n                \u003cdiv id\u003d\"envelopeLetter\" class\u003d\"hidden text-left space-y-6 font-serif pt-4 leading-relaxed text-stone-800 dark:text-rose-100\"\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class\u003d\"border-b border-rose-300 dark:border-rose-800 pb-4 flex justify-between items-center\"\u003e\n                        \u003cspan class\u003d\"font-cursive text-3xl text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400\"\u003eDearest Katy,\u003c/span\u003e\n                        \u003cspan class\u003d\"text-xs font-sans text-stone-500 dark:text-rose-300/60\"\u003e365 Days Later\u003c/span\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n\n                    \u003cp class\u003d\"text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\"\u003e\n                        Hey Katy,\nOne year with you has been amazing, and I could never imagine that I’d be loving and so intertwined with a girl like you. I do believe that we are both far from being perfect human beings, and the ‘perfect’ couple, but I think you are the closest thing to perfection there is in my eyes. There honestly aren’t enough words to describe how amazing you are to me, and I don’t think there ever will be. We’ve definitely had a fair share of our rough patches, but however, I do think that our rough patches have been relatively minor, such as small hills that we needed to overcome, rather than the big mountains that others may face, and I hope it continues to stay this way. If you were to ask me what my favourite moments I’ve had with you were, I’d say all of them. But that’s not fair to say, so I’ll mention some. I loved spending the week with you when your mum went to Perth. It really gave us a small taste of what life could be like with each other in the future, and if I be honest, I was and still am all for it. I also love your little phases of craving specific foods, and it’s so cute to see your face light up when you get it. Anyways, those were just little snippets of my favourite moments with you, and I could go on and on about everything. Every moment with you is special and I hope you know that. To be honest, I never knew that our relationship would blossom into what it is today. I never expected for you to meet my family so quick, and I definitely did not expect to go on a family trip 6 months in, and to go on a trip with your family to Melbourne either. Back then, my mum wouldn’t even let me go out late, so to let me go interstate and to be left in the care of another family is definitely something quite big and significant, and I think that’s what our relationship has become. It’s definitely something I could see working out long term, and everyday I grow more and more sure wanting you as mine forever. I love how you always cherish and support me no matter what, and always celebrate the small goals that I achieve. Your love goes a long way, and I’ve never felt so much love and support from anything ever, and I will always treasure you, and your love towards me. I’ll always be here as your cheerleader, and lover, and I’ll promise I’ll always lend you a hand no matter what, when and where. I love our little side quests, and I’ll always cherish those as well. I think we’ve really developed as a couple, and it’s crazy to see how far we’ve come from day one with all our new experiences.\n\nAnyways, It’s crazy to imagine that we’ve been together for OVER a year now, and I wish there will be many more. I hope you know that I love you very very much although I don’t express it as much as you do, and I’ll give it my all to show you it more often in the near future. I can’t think of anyone else I’d want to do life with other than you, and I promise you’ll always be my number one. And the part we’ve all been waiting for. Happy one year anniversary Katy Tran, I love you very much, and it’d be an understatement if I said that this past year was the best year of my life.\n\n\nP.S. Katy probably has to go back to studying!! Go back to studying!!\n\n                    \u003c/p\u003e\n\n                    \u003cdiv class\u003d\"pt-6 border-t border-rose-300 dark:border-rose-800 flex justify-between items-end\"\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv\u003e\n                            \u003cspan class\u003d\"block text-xs font-sans text-stone-500 dark:text-rose-300/60\"\u003eForever \u0026 Always,\u003c/span\u003e\n                            \u003cspan class\u003d\"font-cursive text-3xl text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400\"\u003eJJ\u003c/span\u003e\n                        \u003c/div\u003e\n                        \u003cbutton onclick\u003d\"event.stopPropagation(); toggleEnvelope()\" class\u003d\"text-xs font-sans text-rose-600 hover:underline\"\u003eClose Letter\u003c/button\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/section\u003e\n\n    \u003c!-- SECTION 6: FUTURE BUCKET LIST --\u003e\n    \u003csection id\u003d\"bucketlist\" class\u003d\"py-20 px-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class\u003d\"text-center space-y-3 mb-12\"\u003e\n            \u003cspan class\u003d\"text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 font-semibold text-xs tracking-widest uppercase\"\u003eLooking Ahead\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003ch2 class\u003d\"font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-stone-900 dark:text-rose-100\"\u003eOur Year Two Bucket List\u003c/h2\u003e\n            \u003cp class\u003d\"text-stone-600 dark:text-rose-300/80 max-w-md mx-auto\"\u003eAdventures and goals JJ \u0026 Katy will accomplish next.\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n\n        \u003cdiv class\u003d\"bg-white/80 dark:bg-darkcard/80 border border-rose-200 dark:border-rose-900/60 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-md\"\u003e\n            \u003cform id\u003d\"bucketForm\" onsubmit\u003d\"addBucketItem(event)\" class\u003d\"flex gap-2 mb-8\"\u003e\n                \u003cinput type\u003d\"text\" id\u003d\"bucketInput\" placeholder\u003d\"Add a new goal, dream, or getaway for Year 2...\" required class\u003d\"flex-1 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-rose-50/50 dark:bg-rose-950/30 border border-rose-200 dark:border-rose-800 text-stone-900 dark:text-rose-100 placeholder-stone-400 dark:placeholder-rose-300/40 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-500\"\u003e\n                \u003cbutton type\u003d\"submit\" class\u003d\"px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-500 text-white font-medium text-sm transition-colors flex items-center gap-1\"\u003e\n                    \u003ci data-lucide\u003d\"plus\" class\u003d\"w-4 h-4\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\n                    \u003cspan\u003eAdd\u003c/span\u003e\n                \u003c/button\u003e\n            \u003c/form\u003e\n\n            \u003cul id\u003d\"bucketListContainer\" class\u003d\"space-y-3\"\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/section\u003e\n\n    \u003cfooter class\u003d\"py-12 border-t border-rose-200/50 dark:border-rose-900/50 text-center text-stone-500 dark:text-rose-300/60 text-sm\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class\u003d\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-3\"\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class\u003d\"flex justify-center items-center gap-2\"\u003e\n                \u003ci data-lucide\u003d\"heart\" class\u003d\"w-5 h-5 text-rose-500 fill-rose-500\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\n                \u003cspan class\u003d\"font-serif font-bold text-stone-800 dark:text-rose-200 text-base\"\u003eJJ \u0026 Katy\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cp class\u003d\"italic\"\u003e\"\u0027Poo Bum\u0027 ~ Katy Tran\"\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/footer\u003e\n\n    \u003c!-- MODAL FOR CHAPTER DETAILS --\u003e\n    \u003cdiv id\u003d\"milestoneModal\" class\u003d\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm hidden opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class\u003d\"bg-white dark:bg-darkcard border border-rose-200 dark:border-rose-800 rounded-3xl max-w-xl w-full p-6 sm:p-8 relative shadow-2xl overflow-hidden transform scale-95 transition-transform duration-300 max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto\" id\u003d\"milestoneModalContent\"\u003e\n            \u003cbutton onclick\u003d\"closeMilestoneModal()\" class\u003d\"absolute top-4 right-4 p-2 rounded-full bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-900/50 text-stone-600 dark:text-rose-200 hover:bg-rose-200 transition-colors\"\u003e\n                \u003ci data-lucide\u003d\"x\" class\u003d\"w-5 h-5\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\n            \u003c/button\u003e\n            \u003cdiv id\u003d\"modalBody\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\n    \u003cscript\u003e\n        // Start Date: October 17, 2025, at 2:44 PM (14:44:00)\n        const START_DATE \u003d new Date(\"2025-10-17T14:44:00\").getTime();\n\n        const milestones \u003d [\n            {\n                id: 1,\n                title: \"Katy\u0027s Birthday\",\n                shortDesc: \"A rollercoaster of emotions for JJ\",\n                longDesc: \"My first fond memory of ‘us’ is when you invited me to your birthday party. It was honestly quite unexpected from my end, and I cannot put into words the excitement, joy and hope I felt when you invited me. When I got the invite, I’m pretty sure I texted my friends, and they were like ‘you’re kidding’. One of my friends even asked me if I asked to go to your birthday party instead of being invited haha. I think that’s how unbelievable it was, and that’s how big of a crush I had on you during that time. In all honesty, you and your friends made a genius move to allow me to bring a plus one because I think I would’ve been too nervous to attend! Your party was definitely a rollercoaster of emotions for me. That night, I thought that you either still liked Will, or you guys were dating, especially with him being able to grab that seat next to you. In that moment, I felt quite sad haha. The rest of the night went well, and we were able to ride our scooters together! (although we fell behind sooo much that kyle had to go back to check on us) I was honestly quite scared of you falling off if I tried driving so I let you ride your own scooter. And, because we valued our lives so much, we decided to teach you how to ride a scooter down the sketchiest alleyway ever. I also remember going to the casino, and then bar hopping around and then playing never have I ever, and kiss marry kill. My hopes rose again when you said out of the three, you’d go out on a date with me, but they were killed once again when you said you’d kiss me, and marry Will. I now understand you were trying not to be obvious, but I think that night you made me sad twice lol, and I was so confused on whether you liked me or not. I think I thought to myself like why won’t she marry me or date me? We then went to karaoke later that night, and when we had to leave, I got my first ever hug from you, and I think our relationship was all uphill from then on! I remember walking out the karaoke place, and calling albin and sooking and crying to him about everything. I also remember going home, getting locked out the house, and getting yelled at but at that moment i didnt care at all, and I went to go find soju to drink in the dark haha. Although that night was a rollercoaster, I think I sometimes look back and laugh at my thought process, and it is going to go down as one of my most memorable nights ever, if not my most memorable one. Maybe our children will hear this story.\",\n                quote: \"JJ did not sook about this the night he got home, or the days after ~ The ghost in JJ\u0027s room\",\n                icon: \"sparkles\"\n            },\n            {\n                id: 2,\n                title: \"Movie night\",\n                shortDesc: \"Mooncakes, Labubu\u0027s, a spinning mirror, and near car crash at Hungry Jacks\",\n                longDesc: \"This was our first ever ‘date’ or ‘hangout’ but hey, you can decide on what you wanted it to be. I remember asking my friends how to ask you to go, and being so nervous when i sent that message. Luckily, the pretty girl i asked to go to the cinemas with me said yes! I remember you getting lost in Elizabeth, and coming maybe 15 minutes late. Leading into the movie, I wasn’t sure on whether I was more scared and nervous to watch the movie, or whether I was more scared and nervous to be sitting next to the girl that I had a crush on! During the movie, there were many times where I wanted to hold your hand, but I wasn’t sure if that was our dynamic yet. I also remember you laughing at literally every scary scene, and thinking back, the signs were there. After the movie, I gave you a Labubu, and some mooncakes that were somewhat expensive for their size. I thought that was it after, and was initially planning to leave leave after that because I wasn’t sure what to do, but you initiated something related to driving me and I was more than up for it! I think driving us around, going to the hungry jacks drive through and nearly crashing, getting some ice creams, and then talking for a while was honestly really sweet, and I was another chance to get to know you. I remember you said in the car that you wanted me to stay longer, and I thought that was really sweet, and I think those were some of the hints that I desperately needed to know that you possibly liked me back! I remember when we were leaving, since some got lost on the way to Elizabeth, I decided to lead the way back to your house so that you wouldn’t get lost another time. (especially since it was dark already) I think that was the simpiest thing that I had done at the time, and I don’t regret it one bit. I also remember getting to your house and asking for a hug by saying ‘hug!’ and when I left, I was like, omg why’d I say it like that.\",\n                quote: \"A date or a hangout, we\u0027ll never know 👀\",\n                icon: \"sparkles\"\n            },\n            {\n                id: 3,\n                title: \"Oktoberfest\",\n                shortDesc: \"Katy on a committee as always, and a night to remember\",\n                longDesc: \"I remember Oktoberfest somewhat well, and I know that it was on a Friday right after clinic. I remember mid-year, when it was brought up I wasn’t gonna go, but as it got closer to the date, I decided to go because I honestly liked you even more. I remember buying a Banh Mi, and was going to give it to you at Clinic, but someone took the bus instead while I was at the shopping centre like 3 minutes away haha. I then drove to the city, and that honestly took way longer than expected because I got caught up in about 10 different traffic jams. I remember then finally meeting you at the uni, and accompanying you to where you were working and sitting on the floor for god knows how long haha. Buuut, before we did that, we did get to go on a nice little walk and I enjoyed it very much. I remember midway through your shift, I decided to go on a run because I was cold, and to maybe get rid of some of the nerves. I also remember SOMEONE being a bad influence and giving me some of their beer, and I also remember throwing grass at you because I was bored. After you finished your shift, we immediately left that somewhat dead festival, and went to chinatown! I remember getting those korean corndogs with you, where it took like half an hour for it to come out. However, those thirty minutes went by pretty fast with us both spilling our family tea/lore to each other, and I think that was the first time that I really learnt a lot about you and your family. This day was also the day I made you try my favourite big-back spot called meet desserts where they had that 1L Boba, I actually never ended up finishing that cup because I only got it as an excuse to spend sliiightly more time with you.\",\n                quote: \"First night in chinatown foreshadowing many more to come\",\n                icon: \"heart-handshake\"\n            },\n            {\n                id: 4,\n                title: \"17 October 2025\",\n                shortDesc: \"The day it all happened, the day JJ dreamt of every night\",\n                longDesc: \"I remember asking you if you knew who I liked on the train, and then you literally led me on to think that you thought that I liked someone else. I was so worried on the train, and when I got home. Anyways, let’s fast forward past that embarrassing time! I remember asking you what we were because my friends were asking. Obviously, we knew who we both liked at that point, and the feelings were mutual. Although I knew all this, I did not expect for you to ask me out as I was in clinic, and it was honestly sooo unexpected. I can’t lie, when I saw it, I had the biggest smile on my face, and walking out of clinic, my eyes were glued to my phone to shoot you back a reply as soon as I could. You really do know how to make me the happiest guy alive, before and after us starting our relationship. \u003c3\",\n                quote: \"Walked in clinic single, walked out clinic taken.\",\n                icon: \"compass\"\n            }\n        ];\n\n        const memoryNotes \u003d [\n            { id: 1, category: \"Sweet Moment\", title: \"Lunch Dates\", desc: \"Our little lunch dates where we\u0027d go eat something we crave.\", tag: \"Thoughtful\", icon: \"coffee\" },\n            { id: 2, category: \"Inside Joke\", title: \"Uncontrollable Laughs\", desc: \"Our little laughs and gags\", tag: \"Laughter\", icon: \"smile\" },\n            { id: 3, category: \"Comfort\", title: \"Cozy Days \u0026 Nights\", desc: \"Staying inside, watching a shows or a movie, and enjoying each others company.\", tag: \"Cozy\", icon: \"cloud-rain\" },\n            { id: 4, category: \"Adventure\", title: \"Car Rides\", desc: \"Driving around with you and the crazy Adelaide traffic\", tag: \"Adventure\", icon: \"car\" },\n            { id: 5, category: \"Milestone\", title: \"Hugs\", desc: \"Hugs that felt like every piece of a puzzle fitting into place.\", tag: \"Love\", icon: \"heart\" },\n            { id: 6, category: \"Everyday Joy\", title: \"Simple Errands\", desc: \"Making simple daily errands feel like a fun date because we were together.\", tag: \"Joy\", icon: \"shopping-bag\" }\n        ];\n\n        const reasonsList \u003d [\n            \"The way you always look out for me, and care for me.\",\n            \"How you always know how to comfort me\",\n            \"Your kindness, patience, and caring heart\",\n            \"The cozy, safe feeling I get whenever I\u0027m with you\",\n            \"The way you fit into my family like a missing piece, and the way you treat everyone with kindness and respect\",\n            \"How supportive and encouraging you are of everything I do.\"\n        ];\n        let currentReasonIdx \u003d 0;\n\n        let bucketList \u003d [\n            { id: 1, text: \"Sleepover with parents home\", done: false },\n            { id: 2, text: \"2 Years\", done: true },\n            { id: 3, text: \"Road trip somewhere nice\", done: false },\n            { id: 4, text: \"Go on an international trip together\", done: false }\n        ];\n\n        window.onload \u003d function() {\n            loadLocalStorage();\n            initHeartsCanvas();\n            renderTimeline();\n            renderMemoryCards();\n            renderBucketList();\n            startTimer();\n            lucide.createIcons();\n\n            document.getElementById(\u0027themeToggleBtn\u0027).addEventListener(\u0027click\u0027, toggleTheme);\n        };\n\n        function loadLocalStorage() {\n            const savedBucket \u003d localStorage.getItem(\u0027jj_katy_bucket\u0027);\n            if (savedBucket) bucketList \u003d JSON.parse(savedBucket);\n        }\n\n        function startTimer() {\n            function update() {\n                const now \u003d new Date().getTime();\n                const diff \u003d Math.max(0, now - START_DATE);\n\n                const days \u003d Math.floor(diff / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24));\n                const hours \u003d Math.floor((diff % (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24)) / (1000 * 60 * 60));\n                const minutes \u003d Math.floor((diff % (1000 * 60 * 60)) / (1000 * 60));\n                const seconds \u003d Math.floor((diff % (1000 * 60)) / 1000);\n\n                document.getElementById(\u0027countDays\u0027).innerText \u003d days.toLocaleString();\n                document.getElementById(\u0027countHours\u0027).innerText \u003d hours.toLocaleString();\n                document.getElementById(\u0027countMinutes\u0027).innerText \u003d minutes.toLocaleString();\n                document.getElementById(\u0027countSeconds\u0027).innerText \u003d seconds \u003c 10 ? \u00270\u0027 + seconds : seconds;\n            }\n            update();\n            setInterval(update, 1000);\n        }\n\n        function renderTimeline() {\n            const container \u003d document.getElementById(\u0027timelineContainer\u0027);\n            container.innerHTML \u003d \u0027\u0027;\n\n            milestones.forEach((m, idx) \u003d\u003e {\n                const isLeft \u003d idx % 2 \u003d\u003d\u003d 0;\n                const card \u003d document.createElement(\u0027div\u0027);\n                card.className \u003d `flex items-center justify-between w-full flex-col md:flex-row ${isLeft ? \u0027md:flex-row-reverse\u0027 : \u0027\u0027} group`;\n                \n                card.innerHTML \u003d `\n                    \u003cdiv class\u003d\"hidden md:block w-5/12\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class\u003d\"z-20 flex items-center justify-center bg-rose-600 text-white w-10 h-10 rounded-full shadow-lg border-4 border-white dark:border-darkbg group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform my-2 md:my-0\"\u003e\n                        \u003ci data-lucide\u003d\"${m.icon}\" class\u003d\"w-5 h-5\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv onclick\u003d\"openMilestoneModal(${m.id})\" class\u003d\"w-full md:w-5/12 bg-white/80 dark:bg-darkcard/80 border border-rose-200 dark:border-rose-900/60 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:shadow-xl hover:border-rose-400 dark:hover:border-rose-700 transition-all cursor-pointer backdrop-blur-sm transform hover:-translate-y-1\"\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class\u003d\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-950/80 text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-300 text-xs font-semibold mb-2\"\u003eChapter ${idx + 1}\u003c/div\u003e\n                        \u003ch3 class\u003d\"font-serif text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 dark:text-rose-100\"\u003e${m.title}\u003c/h3\u003e\n                        \u003cp class\u003d\"text-stone-600 dark:text-rose-300/80 text-sm mt-2 line-clamp-2\"\u003e${m.shortDesc}\u003c/p\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class\u003d\"mt-4 flex items-center text-xs font-semibold text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 gap-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\"\u003e\n                            \u003cspan\u003eRead Story\u003c/span\u003e\n                            \u003ci data-lucide\u003d\"arrow-right\" class\u003d\"w-3.5 h-3.5\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\n                        \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                `;\n                container.appendChild(card);\n            });\n            lucide.createIcons();\n        }\n\n        function openMilestoneModal(id) {\n            const item \u003d milestones.find(m \u003d\u003e m.id \u003d\u003d\u003d id);\n            if (!item) return;\n\n            const modalBody \u003d document.getElementById(\u0027modalBody\u0027);\n            modalBody.innerHTML \u003d `\n                \u003cdiv class\u003d\"space-y-4\"\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class\u003d\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-900/60 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-300 flex items-center justify-center\"\u003e\n                        \u003ci data-lucide\u003d\"${item.icon}\" class\u003d\"w-6 h-6\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003ch3 class\u003d\"font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 dark:text-rose-100\"\u003e${item.title}\u003c/h3\u003e\n                    \u003cp class\u003d\"text-stone-700 dark:text-rose-200/90 leading-relaxed text-sm\"\u003e${item.longDesc}\u003c/p\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class\u003d\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-950/40 border-l-4 border-rose-500 italic font-serif text-rose-900 dark:text-rose-200 text-sm\"\u003e\n                        \"${item.quote}\"\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            `;\n            lucide.createIcons();\n\n            const modal \u003d document.getElementById(\u0027milestoneModal\u0027);\n            modal.classList.remove(\u0027hidden\u0027);\n            setTimeout(() \u003d\u003e {\n                modal.classList.remove(\u0027opacity-0\u0027);\n                document.getElementById(\u0027milestoneModalContent\u0027).classList.remove(\u0027scale-95\u0027);\n            }, 10);\n        }\n\n        function closeMilestoneModal() {\n            const modal \u003d document.getElementById(\u0027milestoneModal\u0027);\n            modal.classList.add(\u0027opacity-0\u0027);\n            document.getElementById(\u0027milestoneModalContent\u0027).classList.add(\u0027scale-95\u0027);\n            setTimeout(() \u003d\u003e modal.classList.add(\u0027hidden\u0027), 300);\n        }\n\n        function renderMemoryCards() {\n            const grid \u003d document.getElementById(\u0027memoryGrid\u0027);\n            grid.innerHTML \u003d \u0027\u0027;\n\n            memoryNotes.forEach(m \u003d\u003e {\n                const card \u003d document.createElement(\u0027div\u0027);\n                card.className \u003d \"bg-white/80 dark:bg-darkcard/80 border border-rose-200 dark:border-rose-900/60 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all backdrop-blur-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:-translate-y-1 group\";\n\n                card.innerHTML \u003d `\n                    \u003cdiv class\u003d\"space-y-3\"\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv class\u003d\"flex items-center justify-between\"\u003e\n                            \u003cspan class\u003d\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-rose-500 dark:text-rose-400\"\u003e${m.category}\u003c/span\u003e\n                            \u003cdiv class\u003d\"p-2 rounded-xl bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-950/60 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-300 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"\u003e\n                                \u003ci data-lucide\u003d\"${m.icon}\" class\u003d\"w-4 h-4\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\n                            \u003c/div\u003e\n                        \u003c/div\u003e\n                        \u003ch4 class\u003d\"font-serif font-bold text-lg text-stone-900 dark:text-rose-100\"\u003e${m.title}\u003c/h4\u003e\n                        \u003cp class\u003d\"text-stone-600 dark:text-rose-300/80 text-sm leading-relaxed\"\u003e${m.desc}\u003c/p\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class\u003d\"mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-rose-100 dark:border-rose-900/40 flex justify-between items-center text-xs\"\u003e\n                        \u003cspan class\u003d\"text-stone-400 dark:text-rose-300/50\"\u003eMemory Token\u003c/span\u003e\n                        \u003cspan class\u003d\"px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-rose-100/70 dark:bg-rose-900/40 text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-300 font-medium\"\u003e${m.tag}\u003c/span\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                `;\n                grid.appendChild(card);\n            });\n            lucide.createIcons();\n        }\n\n        function generateNextReason() {\n            currentReasonIdx \u003d (currentReasonIdx + 1) % reasonsList.length;\n            const textEl \u003d document.getElementById(\u0027reasonQuoteText\u0027);\n            textEl.style.opacity \u003d \u00270\u0027;\n            setTimeout(() \u003d\u003e {\n                textEl.innerText \u003d `\"${reasonsList[currentReasonIdx]}\"`;\n                textEl.style.opacity \u003d \u00271\u0027;\n            }, 200);\n        }\n\n        function toggleEnvelope() {\n            const front \u003d document.getElementById(\u0027envelopeFront\u0027);\n            const letter \u003d document.getElementById(\u0027envelopeLetter\u0027);\n\n            if (letter.classList.contains(\u0027hidden\u0027)) {\n                front.classList.add(\u0027hidden\u0027);\n                letter.classList.remove(\u0027hidden\u0027);\n            } else {\n                letter.classList.add(\u0027hidden\u0027);\n                front.classList.remove(\u0027hidden\u0027);\n            }\n        }\n\n        function renderBucketList() {\n            const container \u003d document.getElementById(\u0027bucketListContainer\u0027);\n            container.innerHTML \u003d \u0027\u0027;\n\n            bucketList.forEach(item \u003d\u003e {\n                const li \u003d document.createElement(\u0027li\u0027);\n                li.className \u003d \"flex items-center justify-between p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-rose-50/50 dark:bg-rose-950/30 border border-rose-100 dark:border-rose-900/30 transition-all\";\n                \n                li.innerHTML \u003d `\n                    \u003clabel class\u003d\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer flex-1\"\u003e\n                        \u003cinput type\u003d\"checkbox\" ${item.done ? \u0027checked\u0027 : \u0027\u0027} onchange\u003d\"toggleBucketItem(${item.id})\" class\u003d\"w-5 h-5 rounded text-rose-600 focus:ring-rose-500 border-rose-300\"\u003e\n                        \u003cspan class\u003d\"text-sm font-medium ${item.done ? \u0027line-through text-stone-400 dark:text-rose-300/40\u0027 : \u0027text-stone-800 dark:text-rose-100\u0027}\"\u003e${item.text}\u003c/span\u003e\n                    \u003c/label\u003e\n                    \u003cbutton onclick\u003d\"deleteBucketItem(${item.id})\" class\u003d\"p-1 rounded text-stone-400 hover:text-rose-600 transition-colors\"\u003e\n                        \u003ci data-lucide\u003d\"trash-2\" class\u003d\"w-4 h-4\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\n                    \u003c/button\u003e\n                `;\n                container.appendChild(li);\n            });\n            lucide.createIcons();\n        }\n\n        function addBucketItem(e) {\n            e.preventDefault();\n            const input \u003d document.getElementById(\u0027bucketInput\u0027);\n            if (!input.value.trim()) return;\n\n            bucketList.push({ id: Date.now(), text: input.value.trim(), done: false });\n            localStorage.setItem(\u0027jj_katy_bucket\u0027, JSON.stringify(bucketList));\n            input.value \u003d \u0027\u0027;\n            renderBucketList();\n        }\n\n        function toggleBucketItem(id) {\n            const item \u003d bucketList.find(b \u003d\u003e b.id \u003d\u003d\u003d id);\n            if (item) {\n                item.done \u003d !item.done;\n                localStorage.setItem(\u0027jj_katy_bucket\u0027, JSON.stringify(bucketList));\n                renderBucketList();\n            }\n        }\n\n        function deleteBucketItem(id) {\n            bucketList \u003d bucketList.filter(b \u003d\u003e b.id !\u003d\u003d id);\n            localStorage.setItem(\u0027jj_katy_bucket\u0027, JSON.stringify(bucketList));\n            renderBucketList();\n        }\n\n        function toggleTheme() {\n            document.documentElement.classList.toggle(\u0027dark\u0027);\n        }\n\n        let widgetOpen \u003d true;\n        function toggleFloatingPlayer() {\n            const container \u003d document.getElementById(\u0027widgetPlayerContainer\u0027);\n            const icon \u003d document.getElementById(\u0027widgetToggleIcon\u0027);\n            \n            if (widgetOpen) {\n                container.style.display \u003d \u0027none\u0027;\n                icon.setAttribute(\u0027data-lucide\u0027, \u0027chevron-up\u0027);\n                widgetOpen \u003d false;\n            } else {\n                container.style.display \u003d \u0027block\u0027;\n                icon.setAttribute(\u0027data-lucide\u0027, \u0027chevron-down\u0027);\n                widgetOpen \u003d true;\n            }\n            lucide.createIcons();\n        }\n\n        function initHeartsCanvas() {\n            const canvas \u003d document.getElementById(\u0027heartCanvas\u0027);\n            const ctx \u003d canvas.getContext(\u00272d\u0027);\n\n            let width \u003d canvas.width \u003d window.innerWidth;\n            let height \u003d canvas.height \u003d window.innerHeight;\n\n            window.addEventListener(\u0027resize\u0027, () \u003d\u003e {\n                width \u003d canvas.width \u003d window.innerWidth;\n                height \u003d canvas.height \u003d window.innerHeight;\n            });\n\n            const hearts \u003d [];\n            for (let i \u003d 0; i \u003c 25; i++) {\n                hearts.push({\n                    x: Math.random() * width,\n                    y: Math.random() * height,\n                    size: Math.random() * 12 + 8,\n                    speedY: Math.random() * 0.8 + 0.3,\n                    opacity: Math.random() * 0.5 + 0.2\n                });\n            }\n\n            function drawHeart(x, y, size, opacity) {\n                ctx.save();\n                ctx.globalAlpha \u003d opacity;\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.fillStyle \u003d \u0027#f43f5e\u0027;\n                const topCurveHeight \u003d size * 0.3;\n                ctx.moveTo(x, y + topCurveHeight);\n                ctx.bezierCurveTo(x, y, x - size / 2, y, x - size / 2, y + topCurveHeight);\n                ctx.bezierCurveTo(x - size / 2, y + (size + topCurveHeight) / 2, x, y + size, x, y + size);\n                ctx.bezierCurveTo(x, y + size, x + size / 2, y + (size + topCurveHeight) / 2, x + size / 2, y + topCurveHeight);\n                ctx.bezierCurveTo(x + size / 2, y, x, y, x, y + topCurveHeight);\n                ctx.closePath();\n                ctx.fill();\n                ctx.restore();\n            }\n\n            function animate() {\n                ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n                hearts.forEach(h \u003d\u003e {\n                    h.y -\u003d h.speedY;\n                    h.x +\u003d Math.sin(h.y * 0.01) * 0.5;\n                    if (h.y \u003c -20) {\n                        h.y \u003d height + 20;\n                        h.x \u003d Math.random() * width;\n                    }\n                    drawHeart(h.x, h.y, h.size, h.opacity);\n                });\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            }\n            animate();\n        }\n    \u003c/script\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e"],"embed-embedUrl","embeds.sites.google.com/internal/code"]]];</script><script src="./1 Year – Google Sites_files/m=e,aa" id="base-js" nonce=""></script><div class="IZH7Bc"></div><div jscontroller="YV8yqd" jsa